      "id": "beacon-settings-page-single-registration",
      "prerequisites": [
        "完整加载模组并进入主菜单。"
      ],
      "profileId": "church-beacon",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-12"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "反复进出主菜单 Mods 页面三次；预期页面正常打开；检查每次进入后本模组设置页面均可见。",
        "统计本模组设置页面的注册数量；预期不重复注册；检查 settings.pageCount=1。",
        "核对信标开关仍存在；预期默认开启；检查 settings.beacon.enabled=true。"
      ],
      "title": "设置页面只注册一次且不重复注册"
    },
    {
      "category": "config",
      "evidence": {
        "log": false,
        "measurement": true,
        "screenshot": true
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "equalsEnvironment": "game.sermonWeekday",
          "observation": "save.sermonWeekday"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "save.isSermonDay"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "state.readable"
        },
        {
          "numberRange": {
            "min": 1
          },
          "observation": "state.sermonReadyValue"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "settings.beacon.enabled"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "beacon.enabled"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "hud.visible"
        },
        {
          "equals": "gksr.hud.sermonReminder",
          "observation": "hud.textKey"
        },
        {
          "finalTextKey": "gksr.hud.sermonReminder",
          "language": "zh-CN",
          "observation": "hud.text"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "beacon.visibleNormal"
        }
      ],
      "id": "beacon-off-keeps-corner-text",
      "prerequisites": [
        "两个门槛任务均为 Completed。",
        "当前为布道日且原生 sermon_ready >= 1。",
        "已在主菜单把信标开关改为关闭。"
      ],
      "profileId": "church-beacon",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-12"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "关闭信标开关后载入满足角落文字条件的存档；预期信标停用；检查 settings.beacon.enabled=false 与 beacon.enabled=false。",
        "核对角落文字；预期仍可见且为 Ready 文案；检查 hud.visible=true 与 hud.textKey=gksr.hud.sermonReminder。",
        "核对资格状态；预期可读且机会未消费；检查 state.readable=true 与 state.sermonReadyValue>=1。"
      ],
      "title": "关闭信标只停用信标并保留角落文字"
    },
    {
      "category": "config",
      "evidence": {
        "log": true,
        "measurement": true,
        "screenshot": true
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "settings.beacon.enabled"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "settings.beacon.appliedOnNextLoad"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "settings.beacon.appliedWithoutRestart"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "beacon.enabledActiveLoadBeforeToggle"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "beacon.visibleActiveLoadBeforeToggle"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "beacon.enabledActiveLoadAfterToggle"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "beacon.visibleActiveLoadAfterToggle"
        },
        {
          "equals": 1,
          "observation": "settings.pageCount"
        }
      ],
      "id": "beacon-setting-apply-next-load-no-restart",
      "prerequisites": [
        "存在满足信标资格的存档（该存档的目标点/图标/组件可用性由外部环境独立记录；关闭状态下组件无需内部解析）。",
        "游戏进程保持运行，未重启。"
      ],
      "profileId": "church-beacon",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-12"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "在开启状态下载入存档；预期信标实际显示；检查 beacon.enabledActiveLoadBeforeToggle=true 与 beacon.visibleActiveLoadBeforeToggle=true。",
        "返回主菜单；预期已退出存档并回到主菜单；检查操作者截图或观察记录确认主菜单可见。",
        "从主菜单 Mods 打开本模组设置页面；预期只注册本模组一个自有页面；检查 settings.pageCount=1。",
        "把信标开关改为关闭；预期保存新的持久值；检查 settings.beacon.enabled=false（持久化值）。",
        "不重启游戏再次载入同一存档；预期按新设置停用信标；检查 settings.beacon.appliedOnNextLoad=true、settings.beacon.appliedWithoutRestart=true、beacon.enabledActiveLoadAfterToggle=false 与 beacon.visibleActiveLoadAfterToggle=false。"
      ],
      "title": "修改设置后再次载入存档即生效且无需重启"
    },
    {
      "category": "config",
      "evidence": {
        "log": true,
        "measurement": true,
        "screenshot": true
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "settings.beacon.survivedRestart"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "settings.beacon.enabled"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "beacon.enabled"
        }
      ],
      "id": "beacon-setting-persists-restart",
      "prerequisites": [
        "已把信标开关改为关闭并确认自动保存。"
      ],
      "profileId": "church-beacon",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-12"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "把信标开关改为关闭并确认自动保存；预期已保存；检查 settings.beacon.enabled=false。",
        "正常退出并重启游戏；预期保留设置；检查 settings.beacon.survivedRestart=true 与 settings.beacon.enabled=false。",
        "载入满足资格的存档；预期信标仍停用；检查 beacon.enabled=false。"
      ],
      "title": "重启游戏后保留已保存的信标设置"
    },
